59	### Modern CSS Techniques (Chrome 105+)
60	
61	Use these cutting-edge CSS features where supported for better UX:
62	
63	**Popover API** (Chrome 114+) — Zero-JS tooltips, info panels, and modals:
64	```html
65	<button popovertarget="info-panel">ℹ Details</button>
66	<div id="info-panel" popover>
