337	### Card Hover Microinteractions
338	All cards should have subtle hover effects — shadow elevation ONLY, no transforms:
339	```css
340	.card, .stat-card, .kpi-card, .stat-item, .chart-container {
341	  transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease;
342	}
343	.card:hover, .stat-card:hover, .kpi-card:hover, .stat-item:hover {
344	  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--border), 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
345	}
346	```
347	- NO `translateY` or `scale` on card hover — it looks cheap
348	- Timeline items: subtle background highlight on hover
349	- Architecture nodes: subtle shadow elevation on hover
350	- List items: subtle background tint on hover, not translateX
351	
352	### :focus-visible Standard
353	Every file MUST include:
354	```css
355	*:focus-visible {
356	  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
357	  outline-offset: 2px;
358	  border-radius: 4px;
359	}
360	```
