362	### SVG Chart Hover Pattern
363	For inline SVG chart elements (bars, donut segments, data points):
364	```css
365	svg rect, svg circle, svg path.data-element {
366	  transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
367	}
368	svg rect:hover, svg circle:hover {
369	  opacity: 0.8;
370	  filter: brightness(1.1);
371	}
