      </header>

      <div class="insight-banner animate delay-1">
        <h3>Key Insight</h3>
        <p>Consumption-stage waste dominates in high-income regions (68.5% in North America & Oceania) but represents only 14% in Sub-Saharan Africa, where production losses are highest. Interventions targeting consumption in wealthy nations and production in developing regions offer the greatest reduction potential.</p>
